/Title (Vidya Setu is an AI-powered inclusive learning platform that personalizes education around each student. It begins with an adaptive diagnostic assessment to identify prerequisite gaps and addresses them within the current-grade learning journey. Students receive curriculum-aligned learning with regional-language and accessibility support. Teachers can use existing modules or upload PDFs/photos to create learning content and assessments. In self-educated mode, parents track the learner's progress. Student activity and assessment results then feed back into the learning journey, helping teachers and parents understand what the learner needs next.)
